⚙️ Setup Instructions
1️⃣ Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/yugssssss/GROCIFY.git
cd GROCIFY

2️⃣ Backend setup
cd Server
npm install
npm start


Create a .env file inside Server/ and add required environment variables.

3️⃣ Frontend setup
npm install
npx react-native run-android

